{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch1iPtRqap1BPGufyjrkc", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I'm stopping the sweep without signing off, because I still have reproduced problems that the developer has not confirmed or fixed.\n\n**Filed reports**\n- **Confirmed and logged:** Folder paste with RENAME. Pasting Alpha into Beta, where Alpha already exists, and choosing RENAME creates no renamed copy. Beta still shows \"1 folders and 2 files\". I reproduced it twice.\n- **Reported, developer could not reproduce:** Bookmarks were alphabetical, not in add order. Alarms, added last, went to the top, and Audiobooks, added last, landed between AndroidQA and DCIM.\n- **Reported, developer could not reproduce:** Grid view reverted to list after rotating the device, in the Amaze folder. I reproduced it twice.\n- **Reported, developer could not reproduce:** Bookmarks added in the drawer disappeared after a rotation. Beta, AndroidQA, Alarms and Audiobooks were all missing afterwards, and only the five defaults remained.\n\n**Checked and working**\n- Copy and paste of a file into another folder, and of a folder without conflict. The pasted folder's contents were intact.\n- Folder rename and back again, with the contents preserved.\n- File rename, including the no-change message.\n- Sort by Size, ascending, with the order correct and kept through rotation.\n- Grid view kept per folder when moving between Amaze and Alpha.\n- Bookmark add from a row menu. The \"Bookmark exists\" message appears for a folder that is already bookmarked.\n\n**Not fully tested**\n- Renaming a file to an existing name, such as photo.jpg to keep.jpg. The dialog closed silently and both files kept their names and sizes, which I did not treat as a bug.\n- Sort \"Only this folder\", bookmark Delete and Modify, and descending sort.\n- The app got stuck after the last rotation. The toolbar scrolled out of view and the drawer would not open. I did not recover it.\n\nThe two bookmark items and the grid item are the ones I would ask the developer to recheck with a rotation and a relaunch, since their repro was not accepted. I did not change any files outside the app's own test data, other than the test renames and bookmark additions noted above."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3803, "cache_read_input_tokens": 323849, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3803}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "adf7005c-89b1-4e11-a52e-0f728e832236", "uuid": "36eed122-8bde-4094-b3c5-903b6daf57d2", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T22:27:19.058Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch1iPt9USLR5w6uvK7obo"}
